{"assets":["/statement-assets/df16a527c39554b801d2f53294de4be14a841950e431f9822a2dbaf26c0ffb9e.png","/statement-assets/c0a4e1b5d1d932c61b9e5ddcb9ac3f77909352016091fdc242210274063deab7.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"856","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Satellites"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Real Cosmic Communications is the largest telecommunication company on a far far away planet, located at the very edge of the universe. RCC launches communication satellites."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The planet is at the very edge of the universe, so its form is half of a circle. Its radius is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":", the ends of its diameter are points "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":". The line "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"AB"},{"kind":"text","text":" is the edge of the universe, so one of the half-planes contains nothing, neither the planet, nor RCC satellites, nor anything else. Let us introduce coordinates in the following way: the origin is at the center of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"AB"},{"kind":"text","text":" segment, "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"OX"},{"kind":"text","text":" axis coincides with line "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"AB"},{"kind":"text","text":", the planet is completely in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y > 0"},{"kind":"text","text":" half-plane."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The satellite can be in any point of the universe, except the planet points. Satellites are never located beyond the edge of the universe, nor on the edge itself — that is, they have coordinate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y > 0"},{"kind":"text","text":". Satellite antennas are directed in such way that they cover the angle with the vertex in the satellite, and edges directed to points "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":". Let us call this area the satellite "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"coverage area"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The picture below shows coordinate system and coverage area of a satellite."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/df16a527c39554b801d2f53294de4be14a841950e431f9822a2dbaf26c0ffb9e.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When RCC was founded there were no satellites around the planet. Since then there have been several events of one of the following types: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1 x y"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — launch the new satellite and put it to the point "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(x, y)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Satellites never move and stay at the point they were launched. Let us assign the number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" to the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th satellite in order of launching, starting from one. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2 i"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — remove satellite number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3 i j"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" — make an attempt to create a communication channel between satellites "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":". To create a communication channel a repeater is required. It must not be located inside the planet, but can be located at its half-circle border, or above it. Repeater must be in coverage area of both satellites "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":". To avoid signal interference, it must not be located in coverage area of any other satellite. Of course, the repeater must be within the universe, it must have a coordinate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y > 0"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each attempt to create a communication channel you must find out whether it is possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Sample test has the following satellites locations: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c0a4e1b5d1d932c61b9e5ddcb9ac3f77909352016091fdc242210274063deab7.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input data contains integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" — radius of the planet and the number of events ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ r ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 5·105"},{"kind":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the following "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe events in the specified format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Satellite coordinates are integer, the satisfy the following constraints "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"|x| ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 < y ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":". No two satellites that simultaneously exist can occupy the same point. Distance from each satellite to the center of the planet is strictly greater than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that events of types "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" only refer to satellites that exist at the moment. For all events of type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" the inequality "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i ≠ j"},{"kind":"text","text":" is satisfied."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each event of type "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" print «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» on a separate line, if it is possible to create a communication channel, or «"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"» if it is impossible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 8\n1 -5 8\n1 -4 8\n1 -3 8\n1 2 7\n3 1 3\n2 2\n3 1 3\n3 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"856E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/856/problem/E"}